      "widgets_values": [
        "For fixing skin on faces highly recommend using dpmpp_sde + karras and the turbo bf16 model.\n\nset to denoise 0.1 or above.\n\nzimage max is 4mp but test lower.\n\nuse prompt that describes the picture and add details of aesthetic film stock in.\n\nalso start with \"a realistic photograph of ...\"\n\n---\n\nfor fixing trees or forest type realism scene try \n\nres_2m or res_2s with ddim_uniform or beta\n\nbut reduce the denoise to 0.1 as it will make changes stronger than other samplers and rise incrementally\n\nbut it wont fix bad anti-aliasaing you'll need to try qwen or klein for that AFAIK."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "For fixing skin on faces highly recommend using dpmpp_sde + karras and the turbo bf16 model.\n\nset to denoise 0.1 or above.\n\nzimage max is 4mp but test lower.\n\nuse prompt that describes the picture and add details of aesthetic film stock in.\n\nalso start with \"a realistic photograph of ...\"\n\n---\n\nfor fixing trees or forest type realism scene try \n\nres_2m or res_2s with ddim_uniform or beta\n\nbut reduce the denoise to 0.1 as it will make changes stronger than other samplers and rise incrementally\n\nbut it wont fix bad anti-aliasaing you'll need to try qwen or klein for that AFAIK."
      },
